# abs_cs_pair_CS_P: pin CS+ (CS_P) within the limit, x derate
#   CS+ to CS- voltage: min -1 / max 100 V (min_ref rel. CS-) (max_ref rel. CS-)
#   DS p.5, 5.1 Absolute Maximum Ratings, Input Pins, CS+ to CS-
#   Conditions: Absolute maximum, pin pair
